# User drafts -- stray personal Markdown files that should not be tracked.
# `*.draft.md` is the recommended naming convention for personal scratch
# drafts kept inside this repo; `viva-cowork-post.md` was a specific stray
# file that got auto-committed by the foundry pipeline before this rule
# existed. Keep this list conservative -- do NOT add a blanket *.md ignore.
*.draft.md
viva-cowork-post.md

